Debug-only, no behavior change. Adds a per-KV-cache-group breakdown of
block allocation to KVCacheCoordinator.get_num_blocks_to_allocate(),
logged whenever free blocks drop below 15% of the pool.

This was the patch that found the real per-token cost split for this
hybrid model: 4 KV-cache groups share one block pool (3x MambaManager +
1x FullAttentionManager, block_size=832 each), not the 1-2 you'd assume
from "hybrid attention+mamba". See docs/mamba-align-prefill-leak.md for
the full writeup this trace produced.

